    },
    {
      "id": "q-00002",
      "text": "I think, therefore I am.",
      "author": null,
      "source": "imported",
      "status": "available",
      "usageCount": 0,
      "usedByAccounts": [],
      "createdAt": "2026-07-08T12:00:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-08T12:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "q-00003",
      "text": "The only true wisdom is in knowing you know nothing.",
      "author": null,
      "source": "imported",
      "status": "available",
      "usageCount": 0,
      "usedByAccounts": [],
      "createdAt": "2026-07-08T12:00:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-08T12:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "q-00004",
      "text": "He who thinks great thoughts often makes great errors.",
      "author": null,
      "source": "imported",
      "status": "available",
      "usageCount": 0,
      "usedByAccounts": [],
      "createdAt": "2026-07-08T12:00:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-08T12:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "q-00005",
      "text": "The happiness of your life depends upon the quality of your thoughts.",
      "author": null,
      "source": "imported",
      "status": "available",
      "usageCount": 0,
      "usedByAccounts": [],
      "createdAt": "2026-07-08T12:00:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-08T12:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "q-00006",
      "text": "We are what we repeatedly do. Excellence, then, is not an act, but a habit.",
      "author": null,
      "source": "imported",
      "status": "available",
      "usageCount": 0,
      "usedByAccounts": [],
      "createdAt": "2026-07-08T12:00:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-08T12:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "q-00007",
      "text": "It does not matter how slowly you go as long as you do not stop.",
      "author": null,
      "source": "imported",
      "status": "available",
      "usageCount": 0,
      "usedByAccounts": [],
      "createdAt": "2026-07-08T12:00:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-08T12:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "q-00008",
      "text": "The journey of a thousand miles begins with a single step.",
      "author": null,
      "source": "imported",
      "status": "available",
      "usageCount": 0,
      "usedByAccounts": [],
      "createdAt": "2026-07-08T12:00:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-08T12:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "q-00009",
      "text": "Knowing yourself is the beginning of all wisdom.",
      "author": null,
      "source": "imported",
      "status": "available",
      "usageCount": 0,
      "usedByAccounts": [],
      "createdAt": "2026-07-08T12:00:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-08T12:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "q-00010",
      "text": "Freedom is what you do with what's been done to you.",
      "author": null,
      "source": "imported",
      "status": "available",
      "usageCount": 0,
      "usedByAccounts": [],
      "createdAt": "2026-07-08T12:00:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-08T12:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "q-00011",
      "text": "Life is really simple, but we insist on making it complicated.",
      "author": null,
      "source": "imported",
      "status": "available",
      "usageCount": 0,
      "usedByAccounts": [],
      "createdAt": "2026-07-08T12:00:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-08T12:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "q-00012",
      "text": "The secret of change is to focus all of your energy not on fighting the old, but on building the new.",
      "author": null,
      "source": "imported",
      "status": "available",
      "usageCount": 0,
      "usedByAccounts": [],
      "createdAt": "2026-07-08T12:00:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-08T12:00:00.000Z"
    }
  ]
}